# This repo's README is about this repo (the www.oiueei.com deployment), not the
# product. Upstream's README is the whole-project document and this one never
# tracks it, so a merge from `oiueei/standalone` should keep ours untouched.
# Requires `git config merge.ours.driver true` once per clone; without it git
# falls back to a normal (conflicting) merge, which is still resolved "keep ours".
README.md merge=ours
